        "original_id": "a7f4765a-db9c-5807-9151-85f3cec0c424",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Masako, Crown Princess of Japan; Naruhito; Akihito; Michiko; Aiko, Princess Toshi\n- Roles: Crown Princess of Japan; Crown Prince of Japan; Emperor of Japan; Empress of Japan; heir apparent\n\nFacts:\n- Michiko was born as Michiko Shōda on 20 October 1934.\n- Akihito has reigned as Emperor of Japan since 7 January 1989.\n- Michiko is the Empress of Japan as the wife of Akihito.\n- Masako, Crown Princess of Japan, was born as Masako Owada on 9 December 1963.\n- Naruhito is the eldest son of Emperor Akihito and Empress Michiko and is the heir apparent to the Chrysanthemum Throne.\n- Masako is the wife of Naruhito, Crown Prince of Japan.\n- Aiko, Princess Toshi, was born on 1 December 2001.\n- Aiko is the only child of Crown Prince Naruhito and Crown Princess Masako of Japan.",
